        Cell["An integer index-three example uses a=6,b=4,c=54,d=4,f=-135. \
The first total is 108+432-540=0. The determinant total is \
-432-2592-2160+11664-6480=0. Its square is nonzero but its cube is zero.", 
         "Text", ExpressionUUID -> "c11ab843-d01b-b149-b65c-b53d8ffed119"], 
        Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell[BoxData[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"index3Example", 
