        Cell["The exact decisions above use real univariate quantifier \
elimination on u after the complete parameterization. They are not labels \
inferred from a bounded matrix search. Setting b,d to their desired signs \
loses no sign possibilities, because their magnitudes contribute only \
positive factors in these formulas. The representative witnesses \
independently verify every permitted arrangement.", "Text", 
         ExpressionUUID -> "a29b328b-0d97-774e-a220-caf76c2fa1d7"], 
        Cell["The four square-zero sign arrangements can also admit \
index-three matrices. For example, choose b=d=1 and compare u=0 with u=1/4: \
both have signs -+-++, but their indices differ. A sign pattern therefore \
need not determine the nilpotency index.", "Text", ExpressionUUID -> 
          "c045724a-416f-7949-9638-52229d50c5b2"], 
        Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell[BoxData[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"sameSignTuples", 
                  "=", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"paramTuple", "[", 
                        RowBox[{"1", ",", "1", ",", "0"}], "]"}], ",", 
                      RowBox[{"paramTuple", "[", RowBox[{"1", ",", "1", ",", 
                          FractionBox["1", "4"]}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"sameSignMatrices", "=", 
                  RowBox[{"mat", "/@", "sameSignTuples"}]}], ";"}], 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"recordCheck", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"\"Different indices in one sign arrangement\"", 
                    ",", RowBox[{"nilIndex", "/@", "sameSignMatrices"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"2", ",", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], 
                ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"recordCheck", 
                  "[", RowBox[{"\"Their signs agree\"", ",", RowBox[
                     {"signText", "/@", "sameSignTuples"}], ",", RowBox[
                     {"{", RowBox[{"\"-+-++\"", ",", "\"-+-++\""}], "}"}]}], 
                  "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
                RowBox[{RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
                        RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {"sameSignTuples", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "i", 
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", TagBox[RowBox[
                          {"sameSignMatrices", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "i", 
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], Function[BoxForm`e$, 
                          MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]], ",", RowBox[{"nilIndex", 
